# LiveView size

One LiveView per page. Extract socket helpers into sibling modules (`RoomLive.Queue`, `RoomLive.Lyrics`, …), not LiveComponents, unless there is a real isolated-state need.

If a LiveView grows past a few hundred lines of events, split by concern (queue / lyrics / playback) before adding more handlers.

`handle_event` clauses may stay in the LiveView as thin wrappers that call into those modules and return `{:noreply, socket}`.
